| `--align-then-lower` | Pause above the rack, hold that demo frame'"'s arm/gripper targets, and align plate xy to the nearest target site's xy within **1 cm**, for at most **150 physical steps**. While waiting, use zero demo base feed-forward and P feedback with a **0.06 m/s** minimum, regardless of the minimum-speed flag. Then resume the arm/gripper clock and command **vx=vy=0 through lowering, opening and all subsequent replay**. A timeout also freezes the base and is recorded. The release pelvis gate is skipped after alignment. |
